sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant C as Caddy
    participant W as web
    participant A as api
    participant P as postgres as app_public
    participant B as Bedrock Nova Lite

    V->>C: GET /chat
    C->>W: page request
    W-->>V: chat page
    V->>C: POST /api/public/chat
    Note over V,C: the question, explain false, prior codes
    C->>A: POST /public/chat
    Note over C,A: /api removed, visitor IP kept
    A->>A: refuse candidate and email questions
    A->>A: parse the question, including a one-letter typo
    A->>P: open jobs that match skills, city, distance, or a tool line
    P-->>A: matching rows
    A-->>V: plain sentence and job cards
    Note over V,A: this response does not call the model
    V->>C: POST /api/public/explain
    C->>A: POST /public/explain
    A->>B: write two to four sentences from those cards
    B-->>A: the paragraph, or an error
    A-->>V: replace the sentence when the model returns text
    Note over V,B: a Bedrock error leaves the cards and the plain sentence
